      "content": "20mg?? i thought acetaminophen was much higher than that for a 3 year old. are you sure that's enough to break a fever? also, i'm still really worried about the spots not fading under the glass and him being so lethargic. it feels like more than just a cold. if it's just purpura, why isn't it going away when i press on it? should i be looking for other symptoms like a stiff neck or something?",
